WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.868
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:03.937
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:04.971
And now we're
gonna get to the news.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.573
After Politico
reported on a draft

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:09.542
that a Supreme Court
majority opinion

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.144
that overturned Roe vs. Wade,

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.446
Republican Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.315
tweeted yesterday that it was

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:18.417
"The most significant and
glorious news of our lifetime."

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:21.855
Now, I'm not a legal scholar,
but I do know this --

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.990
if you made that lady happy,

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.193
you did something very bad.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.362
President Biden
released a statement today

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.230
about the leaked
Supreme Court opinion

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.666
and said that if abortion rights
are rolled back,

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.468
voters will have to elect

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.737
more pro-choice officials
in the midterms.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:40.840
Okay, you got to stop
putting this on the voters.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.110
You're the president with
control of the House and Senate.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.212
We did the voting thing.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:49.415
That's like me blaming
a bad show on an intern.

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.284
Does it feel good in the moment?

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.252
Yeah!

00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:55.989
It feels great,
but, at the end of the day,

00:00:55.989 --> 00:01:00.927
we all know whose fault it
really is -- Wally's.

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:04.363
Health officials
announced yesterday

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:06.599
that the coronavirus infections
in New York City

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:09.702
have reached
a medium-risk threat level,

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:12.605
which means you have to go from
not wearing a mask

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:15.008
to wearing it below your nose.

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:17.577
According to
unconfirmed reports,

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.378
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:21.147
is set to
undergo cancer surgery.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.483
Doctors think that
with their sharpest skills

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:27.554
and a little luck,
they can remove all the Putin.

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:30.223
According to a new study,

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:34.627
a dog's personality has
nothing to do with its breed.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:39.666
For example, a different collie
pushed Timmy into the well.

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:44.970
The series "Grey's Anatomy"

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.773
yesterday celebrated
filming its 400th episode.

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:49.475
That show has been on so long,

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:52.678
all the doctors
are patients now.

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:57.316
A house in Dayton, Ohio, that
has been decorated to look like

00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:59.785
Monica's apartment from
the sitcom "Friends"

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:03.789
is currently up for sale
for $162,000,

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:06.593
which is also what
the monthly rent would be

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:09.295
for Monica's apartment
in Manhattan.

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.365
And, finally,
the luxury gym Equinox

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:14.767
will reportedly begin
accepting cryptocurrency

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.502
as a form of
payment this summer,

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:21.173
while Planet Fitness will begin
accepting Marlboro Miles.

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:22.909
And that was
the monologue, everybody!

